{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：12:30 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"上水警署男警疑吞槍 當場死亡\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b1878e9108a6baca43c0e30cb14d8a69/2026-11/20261126_news_gun_si.png\"/>\n<p>上水警署有警員吞槍死亡。今日（26日）早上10時54分，一名男警員在上水警署內懷疑使用佩槍自轟。救護員到場，經檢驗證實男警當場死亡。</p>\n<p>現場消息稱，死者為隸屬交通部交通意外調查隊警員，今日返早更，早上返到警署後曾與同事一起食早餐。其後同事出更時未見他現身，尋找下發現他在更衣室內懷疑自轟昏迷。警方正調查事件，交新界北總區刑事部跟進。</p>\n<img alt=\"上水警署有男警吞槍。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6e5a8596f26edc98263c4f91687b54a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_24_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f28c58d426d6dff503be349565d122fd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_24.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14c65fd740349b5ee266883fe8a7e7cb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b7a430913cf3fdfd2377f731b9fc04d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_22.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22fcec6481e8fa08dff9e533613d3fbb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_21.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/62bb012ec5a6336845d33f5cbb31670c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_19_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a5beaa39841ff47beb8664c3a78f778/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_19_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"上水警署有男警吞槍，當場死亡。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f432b7a03533bb2320cc9b48c7d6253c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1120d0ed349b1467302eef61c4155c96/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_18.jpeg\"/>\n<p>防止自殺求助熱線：</p>\n<p>「情緒通」精神健康支援熱線及WhatsApp：18111；網址：https://www.shallwetalk.hk/zh/<br/>香港撒瑪利亞防止自殺會： 2389 2222<br/>生命熱線： 2382 0000<br/>明愛向晴軒： 18288<br/>明愛財困壓力輔導熱線: 3161 0102<br/>社會福利署： 2343 2255<br/>撒瑪利亞會熱線(多種語言)： 2896 0000<br/>東華三院芷若園： 18281<br/>醫管局精神健康專線： 2466 7350<br/>青少年情緒健康網上支援服務「Open 噏」：https://www.openup.hk/service</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:02:21.956685+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":468,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:30:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:55:51.887716+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:55:51.887716+00:00","content_hash":"4bb6ab12a5eb97be2c18a801191a7227719754bca7280587d4daaab2c039ff2a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}